CAF_TEXT(kTheseOptionsApplyLiveToEveryIndependentActorIncluding, "These options apply live to every independent actor, including formal scenes and previews. Scene playback always suppresses graph motion; its blend and animation settings remain scene-owned.", "这些选项实时应用于所有独立播放角色，包括正式场景和预览。场景播放始终抑制行为图位移；混合与动画设置仍由场景管理。")
