CAF_TEXT(kPlaceLooseHKXFilesUnderDataMeshesActorsCharacter, "Place loose HKX files under Data/meshes/actors/character/animations/CAF before starting Skyrim. No live registration into existing binding sets.", "启动 Skyrim 前，将散装 HKX 文件放入 Data/meshes/actors/character/animations/CAF。不会实时注册到已有绑定集。")
