CAF_TEXT(kTheOriginalGraphKeepsRunningCAFSamplesItsOwn, "The original graph keeps running; CAF samples its own HKX and overwrites the root graph pose. No CAF_ControlSlot, dummy HKX or CAF_Enter event is required.", "原始行为图继续运行；CAF 采样自己的 HKX 并覆盖根行为图姿态。无需 CAF_ControlSlot、占位 HKX 或 CAF_Enter 事件。")
CAF_TEXT(kLegacyDiagnosticReplacesAnExistingNamedClipVanillaTransitions, "Legacy diagnostic: replaces an existing named clip. Vanilla transitions may interrupt this mode.", "旧诊断模式：替换已有的指定片段。原版状态切换可能打断此模式。")
