CAF_TEXT(kSuppressGraphMotionUseCAFAnimationMotionKeepOriginal, "Suppress graph motion\0Use CAF animation motion\0Keep original graph motion\0", "抑制行为图位移\0使用 CAF 动画位移\0保留原始行为图位移\0")
CAF_TEXT(kSuppressGraphMotionAlsoAppliesPhysicsIsolationCAFOriginal, "Suppress graph motion also applies physics isolation. CAF/original motion modes retain engine movement by default. Configure global isolation in the Configuration tab; it also affects scenes and previews.", "抑制行为图位移也会应用物理隔离。CAF/原始位移模式默认保留引擎移动。全局隔离在“配置”页设置，也影响场景与预览。")
