CAF_TEXT(kIndependentAnnotationsForwardNativeFootstepsAndSoundPlayToGraph, "Independent annotations forward native footsteps and SoundPlay to graph listeners. Attack markers require an existing native attack context. History reports dispatch or skips; dispatch does not prove a hit. Seek emits no catch-up markers or motion. AI/input controls are on the Control tab.", "独立播放注解将原版脚步与 SoundPlay 转发给行为图监听器。攻击标记需要已有的原版攻击上下文。历史记录显示派发或跳过；派发不代表命中。跳转不补发标记或位移。AI/输入控制位于“控制”页。")
