CAF_TEXT(kClickAnEventMarkerToJumpEditBlueAlign, "Click an event marker to jump / edit. Blue: align, green: sound, red: death, purple: bind, orange: unbind, yellow: predictive trigger -> contact.", "点击事件标记以跳转 / 编辑。蓝：对齐，绿：声音，红：死亡，紫：绑定，橙：解绑，黄：预测触发 -> 接触。")
