CAF_TEXT(kSourceSelectedABActorWorksWithoutAnIndependent, "Source: selected A/B actor. Works without an Independent clip. Compare these routes during idle and Independent playback; results appear in History.", "来源：选中的 A/B 角色。无需独立片段。空闲与独立播放时比较这些路径；结果显示在历史记录中。")
