CAF_TEXT(kAttackEventsCanTriggerRealCombatEffectsWhenNative, "Attack events can trigger real combat effects when native attack context exists. History records attack state/data; this probe does not create an attack or choose a target.", "存在原版攻击上下文时，攻击事件可能触发真实战斗效果。历史记录攻击状态/数据；此探测不会创建攻击或选择目标。")
