CAF_TEXT(kSoundPlayPayloadExpectsAVanillaSOUNEditorIDEG, "SoundPlay payload expects a vanilla SOUN EditorID (e.g. NPCHumanCombatShieldBash). Direct playback also accepts SNDR. Enter a known vocal sound to test character audio.", "SoundPlay 参数需要原版 SOUN EditorID（如 NPCHumanCombatShieldBash）。直接播放也接受 SNDR。输入已知语音声音测试角色音频。")
