CAF_TEXT(kSoundMappingUsesYourExplicitMATTSelectionNotDetected, "Sound mapping uses your explicit MATT selection, not detected target material. Vanilla effect raycasts from the target bone (100 units); inspect visuals and sound. These impact probes do not deal damage or emit a hit notification. Mods that require real damage need the attack event experiment.", "声音映射使用显式选择的 MATT，并非检测到的目标材质。原版效果从目标骨骼发出射线（100 单位）；请检查视觉与声音。这些冲击探测不造成伤害或发出命中通知。需要真实伤害的模组需使用攻击事件实验。")
