CAF_TEXT(kDefaultsObservationsWithinGameUnitsOfTheSameBaseline, "Defaults: 3 observations within 0.5 game units of the same baseline. One observation accepts the first valid contact. Disabling skips stability waiting; requested pose coverage and valid geometry are still required. Changes apply immediately, reset accumulated observations and persist to the playback settings file.", "默认：相对同一基准，连续 3 次观测在 0.5 游戏单位内。一次观测会接受首次有效接触。禁用后跳过稳定性等待，但仍要求姿态覆盖与有效几何。修改立即生效，清空累计观测并保存到播放设置文件。")
