CAF_TEXT(kAppendATEXITCAMERARESTOREAtTheEndTo, "Append AT EXIT CAMERA RESTORE at the end to restore the camera state captured before playback?", "在末尾追加 AT EXIT CAMERA RESTORE，恢复播放前捕获的相机状态？")
