CAF_TEXT(kBlueEventYellowPredictiveTriggerContactRedPositionShift, "Blue: event | Yellow: predictive trigger/contact | Red: position | Shift: fine drag", "蓝：事件 | 黄：预测触发/接触 | 红：位置 | Shift：精细拖动")
CAF_TEXT(kPoseAlignmentDiagnostics, "Pose / alignment diagnostics", "姿态 / 对齐诊断")
CAF_TEXT(kTraceRealSkeletonAndPoseCoverage, "Trace real skeleton and pose coverage", "追踪真实骨架与姿态覆盖")
CAF_TEXT(kEnableBeforePreviewPlayOrPlayerHitPlaybackCAF, "Enable before Preview, Play or player-hit playback. CAF_TRACE records sampled HKX, written graph output, real Ni bones and contact checkpoints in the SKSE log. Differences are evidence to inspect, not automatic proof of failure.", "在预览、播放或玩家命中播放前启用。CAF_TRACE 在 SKSE 日志中记录 HKX 采样、行为图输出写入、真实 Ni 骨骼与接触检查点。差异需检查，不自动代表失败。")
CAF_TEXT(kCompareSamplingOnNextPlayHit, "Compare sampling on next Play / Hit", "下次播放 / 命中时比较采样")
CAF_TEXT(kOneShotTestUsingTheFirstPredictiveAlignmentPlay, "One-shot test using the first predictive alignment: play to its target and hold, settle at zero, then seek to the same target and hold. Keeps the actors at their start transforms; skips scene effects and HKX annotations, then restores actors. Compare with the existing direct-sampling run in CAF_SAMPLE_COMPARE logs.", "使用首个预测对齐进行一次测试：播放到目标并保持，在零时刻稳定后跳转到同一目标并保持。保持角色起始变换；跳过场景效果与 HKX 注解，最后恢复角色。与 CAF_SAMPLE_COMPARE 日志中已有直接采样结果比较。")
CAF_TEXT(kSamplingComparisonS, "Sampling comparison: %s", "采样比较：%s")
CAF_TEXT(kDumpCurrentPoseHierarchy, "Dump current pose / hierarchy", "导出当前姿态 / 层级")
CAF_TEXT(kRigidProbeSceneSlot, "Rigid probe scene slot", "刚性探测场景槽位")
CAF_TEXT(kProbeTranslationHeadingThenRestore, "Probe translation + heading, then restore", "探测平移 + 朝向，然后恢复")
CAF_TEXT(kRunOnlyInASettledStoppedPreviewTemporarilyMoves, "Run only in a settled, stopped preview. Temporarily moves this actor +120 X / +60 Y and turns heading +0.7 rad for four engine updates. Root transform is restored; collision or world-dependent body responses may persist. PROBE_BONE marks the first hierarchy divergence and whether local pose changed.", "仅在稳定且停止的预览中运行。临时将此角色移动 +120 X / +60 Y，朝向转动 +0.7 弧度，持续四次引擎更新。恢复根变换；碰撞或依赖世界的身体响应可能残留。PROBE_BONE 标记首次层级偏离及局部姿态是否变化。")
CAF_TEXT(kRigidProbeRunning, "Rigid probe running...", "刚性探测运行中…")
CAF_TEXT(kEnableExecutions, "Enable executions", "启用处决")
CAF_TEXT(kAimAtAVulnerableEnemyAndPressYourActivate, "Aim at a vulnerable enemy and press your Activate key (default E). Player = slot 1; enemy = slot 2.", "瞄准脆弱敌人并按交互键（默认 E）。玩家 = 槽位 1；敌人 = 槽位 2。")
CAF_TEXT(kAllowBelowHealthThreshold, "Allow below health threshold", "允许低于生命阈值")
CAF_TEXT(kHealthThreshold, "Health threshold (%)", "生命阈值（%）")
CAF_TEXT(kAllowBleedingOutEssentialDown, "Allow bleeding out / essential down", "允许流血倒地 / 关键角色倒地")
CAF_TEXT(kMaximumDistanceGameUnits, "Maximum distance (game units)", "最大距离（游戏单位）")
CAF_TEXT(kEitherEnabledConditionQualifiesOnlyLivingLoadedEnemiesAre, "Either enabled condition qualifies. Only living, loaded enemies are eligible. The scene handles death.", "任一启用条件满足即可。仅存活且已加载的敌人有效。死亡由场景处理。")
